      model: claude-opus-5
      changed:
      - type
      - semantic_type
      - description
      reason: The page-level vision check places this box in column B under the printed
        header "DATE ACQUIRED" on the item 18 TOTAL ASSETS row, with the separate
        dollar-total boxes in the value columns; the publisher's generic widget name
        "tx"/tooltip "TotalAsset1.tx" only identifies the row, not the column, so
        t
